  day: 4
  text: "Reporting for duty, sir! I appreciate you complying to my requests, sir!
    May I ask you something, sir? How\u2026 Do you do it? Everyday I wake up, in
    my timeslot of 30 min before the first shift, I always complete my routines.
    But I feel empty. SORRY, SIR! THIS IS NOT A PROFESSIONAL CONVERSATION TOPIC,
    SIR! PLEASE ASSIGN ME TO YOUR MOST DIFFICULT MINE AS PUNISHMENT, SIR!"
